Zero point energy                ...      0.11467273 Eh      71.96 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.02521622 Eh      15.82 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00147327 Eh       0.92 kcal/mol
Thermal translational correction ...      0.00147327 Eh       0.92 kcal/mol
